00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,700
The harbour opens at dawn every day

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,700
Fishing boats leave before the moon rises

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,700
Nets are mended on the long pier

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,300
Children watch from the old wall

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,700
A bell rings when the tide turns

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,900
Marcus counts the morning catch

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:32,900
Gulls follow every returning boat

8
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Evening comes quickly here
